.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK REPORT CREATE"
.SH NAME
hamstik report create \- Create an Advanced Report from a complete JSON definition
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik report create [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create an Advanced Report from a complete JSON definition
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --file
JSON file containing an AdvancedReportInput (`-` for stdin)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
